        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="agricultural" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Refers to 1 kg of tallow at rendering plant. Since the process of meat and bone meal production is nearly the same as the production of tallow (all steps are common except the milling of the meal), a physical allocation of the processes has been applied. The inventory can therefore also be used as an approximation for meat and bone meal.;&#10;Synonyms: animal fat, Talg; &#10;UUID: f6655fa7-785d-3dcf-8640-017969ab9db2" includedProcesses="The inventory includes the transport from the slaughterhouse to the rendering plant and  further processing of slaughterhouse wastes to tallow. It includes  the energy demand for operating a rendering plant, in form of electricity and natural gas, the use of tap water, the output of wastewater and the building infrastructure. The animal husbandry and the process of slaughtering are not included, since the raw material is considered as waste. " infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="agricultural" localName="Tallow, at plant" localSubCategory="animal production" name="Tallow, at plant" subCategory="animal production" unit="kg"/>
